          "markdown": "**RoadRunner Reborn** makes your Now Playing app (and optionally other selected apps) stay alive through sbreload and resprings, keeping your music and other apps uninterrupted!\n\nSupports iOS 15 and above, on rootless and RootHide jailbreaks.",
